OL,3,GNEWSAFirst ministers of Wales, Scotland
OL,4,Aand Northern Ireland to meet in Cardiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will hold further talks with Swinney
OL,7,Fin the afternoon with both men expected
OL,8,Fto sign an agreement on "future
OL,9,Fcollaboration in areas of shared
OL,10,Finterest".
